#: header-%3Esubtitle-%3Etext
msgid ""
"A beautiful, high-quality desktop, built on the latest open source "
"technology. Trusted, powerful, easy."
msgstr ""

#: header-%3Eimages-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_framework.png"
msgstr ""

#: header-%3Eimages-%3EbackgroundImage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_background.jpg"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Why Fedora Workstation?"
msgstr "Varför Fedora Workstation?"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Reliable"
msgstr "Pålitlig"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Each version is updated for 18 months, and upgrades between versions are "
"quick and easy."
msgstr ""
"Varje version uppdateras i 18 månader och uppgraderingar mellan versioner är "
"snabba och enkla."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Free & Private"
msgstr "Fri & Privat"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"With Fedora, your desktop is your own. It's free, there are no ads, and your "
"data belongs to you."
msgstr ""
"Med Fedora är ditt skrivbord ditt eget. Det är gratis, det finns inga "
"annonser och din data tillhör dig."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Etitle
msgid "Beautiful"
msgstr "Vacker"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Workstation is carefully curated to deliver a high-quality experience. The "
"desktop is clean and uncluttered."
msgstr ""
"Workstation är noggrant utvald för att leverera en upplevelse av hög "
"kvalitet. Skrivbordet är rent och stilrent."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Etitle
msgid "Trusted"
msgstr "Tillförlitlig"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Developed in partnership with upstream projects. Rigorously tested. Backed "
"by Red Hat."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Etitle
msgid "Leading technology"
msgstr "Ledande teknologi"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Built on the latest technologies and enhancements that open source has to "
"offer."
msgstr ""
"Byggd på den senaste tekniken och förbättringarna som öppen källkod har att "
"erbjuda."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[5]-%3Etitle
msgid "Makes the most of your device"
msgstr "Få ut det mesta av din enhet"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[5]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Fedora works with hardware vendors to make excellent hardware support across "
"a range of devices."
msgstr ""
"Fedora samarbetar med hårdvaruleverantörer för att tillhandahålla utmärkt "
"hårdvarustöd på en rad enheter."

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Features for everyone"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Fantastic Apps"
msgstr "Fantastiska program"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Browse a great collection of apps, covering everything you might need. "
"Includes exciting new open source apps as well as familiar apps from other "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Bläddra i en fantastisk samling program som täcker allt du kan behöva. "
"Innehåller spännande nya program med öppen källkod samt välbekanta program "
"från andra plattformar."

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Eimage-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_software_center.png"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Workstation speaks your language"
msgstr "Workstation pratar ditt språk"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Thanks to a global community of translators, Workstation is available in "
"many languages."
msgstr ""
"Tack vare en global gemenskap av översättare är Workstation tillgänglig på "
"många språk."

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Eimage-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_languages.png"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Etitle
msgid "Turn the lights down low"
msgstr "Slå av ljuset"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Flip a switch to turn on dark mode and give your eyes a break from the day. "
"Use night light to reduce screen glare and help with sleep."
msgstr ""
"Dra i spaken för att aktivera mörkt läge och ge dina ögon en paus från "
"dagen. Använd nattljus för att minska skärmbländning och hjälpa till med "
"sömnen."

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Eimage-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_nightlight.png"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Etitle
msgid "Calendar Integration"
msgstr "Kalenderintegration"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Edescription
msgid "Bring your online calendar to the desktop with online accounts"
msgstr "Ta med din onlinekalender till skrivbordet med onlinekonton"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Eimage-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_calendar.png"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Etitle
msgid "Helpful out of the box"
msgstr "Hjälpsam direkt från start"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Fedora Workstation includes a great set of utilities, like Clocks, Weather "
"and Maps."
msgstr ""
"Fedora Workstation innehåller en bra uppsättning verktyg, som klockor, väder "
"och kartor."

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Eimage-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/workstation_outofthebox.png"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Built By You"
msgstr "Byggt för dig"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Eheader-%3EheaderImage-%3Eimage
#, read-only
msgid "public/assets/images/iot_flock_background.jpg"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Eheader-%3Esubtitle1
msgid ""
"The Fedora Project envisions a world where everyone can benefit from free "
"and open source software built by inclusive, welcoming, and open-minded "
"communities."
msgstr ""
"Fedora-projektet föreställer sig en värld där alla kan dra nytta av gratis "
"programvara med öppen källkod byggd av inkluderande, välkomnande och "
"fördomsfria gemenskaper."

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Eheader-%3Esubtitle2
msgid ""
"Fedora IoT is created by a team in the Fedora community called the IoT "
"Working Group. It is comprised of official members who have decision making "
"powers, as well as other contributors. Learn more on the IoT Working Group "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Fedora IoT skapas av ett team i Fedora-communityt som kallas IoT Working "
"Group. Den består av officiella medlemmar som har beslutsfattande "
"befogenheter, såväl som andra bidragsgivare. Läs mer på IoT Working Groups "
"webbplats."

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Etext
msgid ""
"Fedora Workstation is created by a teamm in the Fedora community called the "
"**Workstation Working Group**. It is comprised of official members who have "
"decision making powers, as well as other contributors. [Learn more onthe "
"Workstation Working Group Website.](https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/"
"workstation-working-group/)"
msgstr ""
"Fedora Workstation skapas av ett team i Fedora-gemenskapen som kallas **"
"Workstation Working Group**. Den består av officiella medlemmar som har "
"beslutsfattande befogenheter, såväl som andra bidragsgivare. [Läs mer på "
"Workstation Working Groups webbplats.](https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/"
"workstation-working-group/)"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Report & discuss issues"
msgstr "Rapportera & diskutera problem"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"You can view, file, and discuss Fedora Workstation issues on [the Fedora "
"Workstation issue tracker]()."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Chat with the team"
msgstr "Chatta med teamet"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Visit **#fedora-workstation** on [irc.libera.chat]() and on **#workstation** "
"[on the Fedora Matrix Chat server]()."
msgstr ""
"Besök **#fedora-workstation** på [irc.libera.chat]() och på **#workstation** "
"[på Fedoras Matrix Chatt server]()."

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Etitle
msgid "Join the mailing list"
msgstr "Gå med i e-postlistan"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Sign up at [desktop@lists.fedoraproject.org]() to receive meeting agendas "
"and minute ([view archives]().)"
msgstr ""
"Registrera dig på [desktop@lists.fedoraproject.org]() för att få "
"mötesagendor och protokoll ([visa arkiv]().)"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Etitle
msgid "Attend a meeting"
msgstr "Närvara vid ett möte"

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Open to all current and potential contributors on **Tuesdays, 9:30 AM US "
"Eastern** on [Bluejeans]()."
msgstr ""
"Öppet för alla nuvarande och potentiella bidragsgivare **tisdagar, 9:30 "
"Östra USA tid** på [Bluejeans]()."

#~ msgid "Benefits"
#~ msgstr "Fördelar"
